Package: tauargusengine
Title: Native R Bindings to the Tau-Argus SDC Engine
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Trygve", "Kleven", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "trygve@example.com")
  )
Description: Thin C/C++ interface to the 'tauargus-engine' native
    statistical-disclosure-control libraries (core, csp, hitas, crp,
    rounder; HiGHS-backed). Exposes the 'TauArgus', 'HiTaSCtrl' and
    'RounderCtrl' objects and the 'audit_jj' routine to R through '.Call'.
    This is a low-level binding; the batch-level orchestration lives in
    'rtauargus'.
License: EUPL-1.2
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: A C++ compiler, a prebuilt 'tauargus-engine'
    (engine/build/lib) and HiGHS (>= 1.x).
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
